//! Exposes the compiled zkVM guests, generated by build.rs: `HELLO_GUEST_ELF` / `HELLO_GUEST_ID` (S0 hello
//! world), `CHECK_GUEST_ELF` / `CHECK_GUEST_ID` (the patch checker) and `OUTPUT_GUEST_ELF` / `OUTPUT_GUEST_ID` (the
//! output checker for wrong output bugs). The ID is the image id, the
